Patch for the libcosmic `iced` submodule (paths are relative to iced/).
Apply with scripts/libcosmic-patched.sh, never by hand.

iced_tiny_skia: remove the dead first `let quality` of the raster pipeline's
draw. The second one, right before `draw_pixmap`, shadows it and is the one
used, so the behaviour is identical; the rustc `unused variable: quality`
warning (it only shows now that the crate is a path dependency) goes away.

